  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fire_token_vendor.png\" title=\"Fire Token Vendor\"><img alt=\"Fire Token Vendor\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"321\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fire_token_vendor.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fire_token_vendor.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Fire Token Vendor</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tleft\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Poison_token_vendor.png\" title=\"Poison Token Vendor\"><img alt=\"Poison Token Vendor\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"306\" src=\"/images/recovered/Poison_token_vendor.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Poison_token_vendor.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Poison Token Vendor</div></div></div>\n<p>The Token Vendors of various sorts are found in the arena with <a href=\"/wiki/Manglefeet\" title=\"Manglefeet\">Manglefeet</a>, Boss of <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>.  They drop <a href=\"/wiki/Token\" title=\"Token\">Tokens</a> which sit and spew out elemental damage, and they can also heal the Boss. They are fairly easy to dispose of if you lure them to the steps.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
